@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
participant ":CommandBox" as Box UI_COLOR
participant ":MainWindow" as Window UI_COLOR
participant ":LogicManager" as Logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":AddressBookParser" as Parser LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":EditCommandParser" as EditParser LOGIC_COLOR
participant "edit:EditCommand" as Edit LOGIC_COLOR
participant "model:Model" as Model MODEL_COLOR
participant "storage:Storage" as Storage STORAGE_COLOR

note over Box, Storage
  Successful edit of the first displayed contact.
  Email parsing errors include no consecutive special characters.
  Parsing, invalid-index and duplicate-name errors stop before mutation.
end note
Box -> Window : executeCommand("edit 1 m/Mathematics c/ t/Project")
activate Window
Window -> Logic : execute(commandText)
activate Logic
Logic -> Parser : parseCommand(commandText)
Parser -> EditParser : parse(" 1 m/Mathematics c/ t/Project")
create Edit
EditParser -> Edit : new EditCommand(index, descriptor)
EditParser --> Parser : edit
Parser --> Logic : edit
Logic -> Edit : execute(model)
activate Edit
Edit -> Model : getFilteredPersonList()
Model --> Edit : displayed contacts
Edit -> Edit : createEditedPerson(person, descriptor)
note right of Edit
  Omitted fields, notes and favourite status survive.
  Blank c/ becomes GraduationYear.EMPTY.
  A basic profile change updates lastUpdated.
end note
opt Name changed
  Edit -> Model : hasPerson(editedPerson)
  Model --> Edit : false
end
alt Contact unchanged
  Edit -> Model : updateFilteredPersonList(PREDICATE_SHOW_ALL_PERSONS)
  Edit --> Logic : CommandResult("No changes made to NAME. ...")
  note right of Edit : Preserve the date and both history stacks.
else Contact changed
Edit -> Model : getAddressBook()
Model --> Edit : contact data to snapshot
Edit -> Edit : previousState = new AddressBook(contact data)
Edit -> Model : setPerson(person, editedPerson)
Edit -> Model : updateFilteredPersonList(PREDICATE_SHOW_ALL_PERSONS)
Edit -> Edit : message = "Edited person: ..."
Edit -> Model : commitAddressBook(previousState, message)
Edit -> Edit : formatChanges(person, editedPerson)
note right of Edit
  Edited NAME: followed by actual field changes.
  Field: old value → new value.
  Empty optional fields show Not specified.
end note
opt Tags changed
  Edit -> Edit : formatTagDifference(oldTags, newTags)
  Edit -> Edit : formatTagDifference(newTags, oldTags)
  note right of Edit
    Append Tags replaced. Removed: ... . Added: ... .
    Sorted actual differences; None when empty.
    Summary appears only in immediate edit feedback.
    Undo/redo description retains the base message.
  end note
end
Edit --> Logic : CommandResult(change summary)
end
deactivate Edit
Logic -> Model : getAddressBook()
Model --> Logic : updated contact data
Logic -> Storage : saveAddressBook(updated contact data)
Storage --> Logic
Logic --> Window : CommandResult
deactivate Logic
Window -> Window : personListPanel.refresh()
Window -> Window : resultDisplay.setFeedbackToUser(feedback)
Window --> Box : CommandResult
deactivate Window
note over Box : Clear the command text after success.
note over Window, Model
  The observable list updates contact cards and displayed indices.
  Cleared academic fields display Not specified.
end note
@enduml
